# A tour of AppRuntime's ExampleUI for Scripts/run-app.sh: edits, the
# stepper, the segmented picker, an alert, the toolbar menu, swipe actions,
# search, navigation to a form with a disclosure group and a confirmation
# dialog, and a sheet with a tab view and a lazy grid. Screenshots go to
# .build/shots/ (create it first). Coordinates are for the default 420 × 760
# window.
# Name field: replace "World".
click 200 160
key end
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
type Linux
expect Hello, Linux!
# Stepper buttons and the segmented picker.
tap +
tap +
expect 2
click 210 242
screenshot .build/shots/02-edited.png
# The alert.
tap Reset
screenshot .build/shots/03-alert.png
tap Reset
expect 0
# The toolbar menu.
tap ↑ Sort
screenshot .build/shots/04-menu.png
tap Reversed
# Swipe actions, as a context menu.
rightclick 200 345
screenshot .build/shots/05-context.png
tap Delete
# Search.
click 200 64
type B
screenshot .build/shots/06-search.png
key backspace
key escape
# Navigation to a detail form.
click 200 345
screenshot .build/shots/07-detail.png
tap Like (0)
expect Like (1)
tap More About Banana
screenshot .build/shots/08-disclosure.png
tap Reset Likes…
screenshot .build/shots/09-dialog.png
key escape
key alt+left
expect Hello, Linux!
# The sheet with a tab view and a lazy grid.
tap About
screenshot .build/shots/10-sheet.png
tap About
screenshot .build/shots/11-about-tab.png
tap Done
expect Hello, Linux!
quit
